ifconfig # to view and configure network interfaces
ping # to check connectivity between two nodes --> It sends ICMP Echo Request packets and waits for ICMP Echo Reply responses
ping -c 5 google.com # Send specific number of packets
ping -i 2 google.com # Set interval between packets
  common usecase :- 
| Task                               | Example                 |
| ---------------------------------- | ----------------------- |
| Check if a host is reachable       | `ping 8.8.8.8`          |
| Check DNS resolution               | `ping google.com`       |
| Measure latency                    | `ping -c 5 example.com` |
| Test internal network connectivity | `ping 192.168.1.1`      |
